          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Electrocautery Pens (Cautery Pens) – Top-Rated Medical Device for Skin Lesions, Skin Tags, Syringoma & Wart Removal",
            "text": "<h2>Buy the Best Electrocautery Pen for Skin Care Professionals and At-Home Use</h2><p><strong>Electrocautery Pens</strong>, also known as <strong>Cautery Pens</strong>, are advanced medical devices designed for safe, effective, and precise skin lesion removal, minor surgical procedures, and cosmetic skin treatments. Harnessing the power of controlled heat, electrocautery pens have become the preferred choice for dermatologists, healthcare professionals, and individuals seeking an efficient and non-invasive solution for various skin concerns.</p><h2>⭐ Product Features & Health Benefits</h2><ul><li><strong>Effortless Skin Tag Removal:</strong> Instantly cauterize and remove skin tags, warts, moles, and benign lesions.</li><li><strong>Precision Treatment for Syringoma:</strong> Specially designed tips offer delicate targeting for syringoma removal without damaging surrounding tissues.</li><li><strong>Effective Wart & Mole Removal:</strong> Destroys wart tissue, minimizing recurrence. Effectively treats plantar warts, common warts, and flat warts.</li><li><strong>Professional & Home Use:</strong> Suitable for dermatology clinics, cosmetic spas, and trained at-home users.</li><li><strong>Portable & Ergonomic:</strong> Lightweight, pen-style design allows easy handling and accuracy.</li><li><strong>Multiple Power Settings:</strong> Adjustable temperature and interchangeable tips for various procedures.</li><li><strong>Sterile & Safe Design:</strong> Disposable and/or autoclavable tips to ensure hygiene and minimize infection risk.</li><li><strong>Immediate Results:</strong> Promotes rapid healing and minimal scarring with proper aftercare.</li><li><strong>FDA Cleared Devices Available:</strong> Certified for quality and safety compliance.</li></ul><p><strong>Order now for the safest, fastest, and most effective skin lesion treatment and removal!</strong></p>",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "text_alignment": "left"
          }
        }
      },
